## Task
生成一个用于 GPT/Codex 的提示词, 实现"支付网关回调处理逻辑"。这是最关键的模块 — 确保支付成功后正确验证并充值用户余额。

## Context
- 技术栈: Node.js (Express) + SQLite
- 支付网关: CloudPaya / GatewayCrypto / FromChain (三者 API 风格类似)
- 用户余额: 存储在 gameState.players[0].wallet 或 localStorage
- 安全要求: HMAC 签名验证 + 防重放 + 幂等性

## 功能要求

### 1. Webhook 端点 (Node.js Express)
```javascript
// POST /api/webhook/crypto
// Headers:
//   X-Signature: HMAC-SHA256(body, merchantSecret)
//   X-Event: payment.completed | payment.expired | payment.failed
//   X-Timestamp: Unix 时间戳
//   X-Nonce: 唯一随机数 (防重放)

router.post('/api/webhook/crypto', async (req, res) => {
  // 1. 验证签名
  const signature = req.headers['x-signature'];
  const event = req.headers['x-event'];
  const timestamp = req.headers['x-timestamp'];
  const nonce = req.headers['x-nonce'];

  if (!verifySignature(req.body, signature, MERCHANT_SECRET)) {
    return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid signature' });
  }

  // 2. 防重放: 检查 nonce 是否已使用过
  if (await isNonceUsed(nonce)) {
    return res.status(200).json({ status: 'duplicate' }); // 防止重复处理
  }
  await markNonceUsed(nonce);

  // 3. 防时间戳攻击 (5 分钟内)
  const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);
  if (Math.abs(now - timestamp) > 300) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'Timestamp expired' });
  }

  // 4. 根据事件类型处理
  const { paymentId, orderId, status, amount, currency, txId, confirmations } = req.body;

  if (event === 'payment.completed' && status === 'completed') {
    // 检查链上确认数
    if (confirmations < REQUIRED_CONFIRMATIONS[currency]) {
      // 未达到确认阈值, 暂不处理, 网关会重试
      return res.status(200).json({ status: 'pending_confirmations' });
    }

    // 5. 幂等性: 检查订单是否已处理
    const order = await getOrder(orderId);
    if (order.status === 'completed') {
      return res.status(200).json({ status: 'already_processed' });
    }

    // 6. 更新订单状态 + 充值用户余额
    await db.transaction(async (tx) => {
      await tx.query(
        "UPDATE crypto_orders SET status = 'completed', tx_id = ?, confirmations = ?, paid_at = NOW() WHERE merchant_order_id = ?",
        [txId, confirmations, orderId]
      );
      await tx.query(
        "UPDATE users SET balance = balance + ? WHERE id = ?",
        [amount, order.customerId]
      );
    });

    // 7. 记录审计日志
    await logAudit({
      action: 'payment_completed',
      orderId,
      userId: order.customerId,
      amount,
      txId,
    });
  }

  // 8. 总是返回 200 (告诉网关已收到)
  res.status(200).json({ status: 'ok' });
});
```

### 2. 签名验证
```javascript
function verifySignature(body, signature, secret) {
  const computed = crypto
    .createHmac('sha256', secret)
    .update(typeof body === 'string' ? body : JSON.stringify(body))
    .digest('hex');
  return timingSafeEqual(computed, signature);
}

// 防止时序攻击
function timingSafeEqual(a, b) {
  if (a.length !== b.length) return false;
  let result = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < a.length; i++) {
    result |= a.charCodeAt(i) ^ b.charCodeAt(i);
  }
  return result === 0;
}
```

### 3. 链上确认数要求
```javascript
const REQUIRED_CONFIRMATIONS = {
  'BTC': 3,
  'ETH': 12,
  'USDT_ERC20': 12,
  'USDT_TRC20': 12,
  'SOL': 1,
};
```

